# Mercedes-Benz S-Class W222 (S350) four-door saloon, 2013-2020.
#
# The W222 S-Class: 5,116 mm long, 1,899 mm wide, 1,496 mm high, 3,035 mm
# wheelbase (long 5,246/3,165); 3.0-6.0 petrol and 3.0 diesel, the S350d the
# volume British model. Facelift in 2017.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-Benz_S-Class_(W222)
#
# Colours: Obsidian Black, Iridium Silver, Selenite Grey and Diamond White are
# period Mercedes-Benz finishes.
#
# Weight: 25 in total (black 10, silver 7, grey 5, white 3).
#
# Speed 250 km/h; comfort 175/440 (line). Class 4.
# Dates: 2013-2020 with a road tail to about 2032.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/mercedes-w222.blend. References:
# citycars/references/mercedes-w222/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

